      "Log weights and reps accurately every session to apply progressive overload week over week.",
      "Rest 2\u20133 minutes on heavy compound lifts and 60\u201390 seconds on isolation accessories.",
      "Prioritize recovery: stay hydrated, hit your daily protein target, and get 7\u20139 hours of sleep."
